<title>USA: CENTRAL EUROPEAN MEDIA MAY SELL MARK JUNK BONDS.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL EUROPEAN MEDIA MAY SELL MARK JUNK BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central European Media Enterprises Ltd may include a mark-denominated tranche in its upcoming $125 million junk bond offering, according to sources close to the transaction.</p>
<p>They said the company is considering several options which include &quot;carving-out&quot; a mark tranche and increasing the overall size of the deal.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;Much of this is market-driven,&quot; said one source close to the situation. &quot;We want to make sure (the issues) will be sufficiently liquid.&quot;</p>
</text>
